            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[### Parental Controls

- Blocking an app is now one sheet: pick Quick, Always or Schedule on the
  left and the app on the right. Scheduling no longer takes three sheets.
- Screen time limits use the same two-pane sheet for adding and editing.
- Refreshed Emergency Code, Device Details and Websites screens to match
  the rest of the app, with a close button on every card.
]]></description>
